              "text": "серьги (sérgi) is the plural of серьга, \"an earring\". One view reshapes Old Russian усерязь, \"an earring\", but Vasmer finds the г hard to explain; Räsänen, in Trubachev's note, derives it from Chagatai and other Turkic isirga, \"ear pendants\"."
